OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow taxi drivers must accept
OL,4,Acard payments from next February
OL,5,
OL,6,FTaxi drivers in Glasgow have been told
OL,7,Fto accept card payments from next year,
OL,8,Fafter councillors agreed to a phased
OL,9,Froll-out of the requirement.
OL,11,FThe city's licensing committee approved
OL,12,Fmaking it mandatory for taxi drivers to
OL,13,Fallow the use of credit and debit cards
OL,14,Fat a meeting on Wednesday.
OL,16,FAny driver granted a new licence or
OL,17,Frenewal from 1 February 2027 will need
OL,18,Fto carry a card reader, with licences
OL,19,Frunning for three years. The move comes
OL,20,Fafter more than 80% of respondents to a
OL,21,Fpublic consultation backed the
OL,22,Fproposal.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
