OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow taxi drivers must accept
OL,4,Acard payments from next February
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council received 1,666 responses,
OL,7,Fwith almost 1,200 from members of the
OL,8,Fpublic and just over 250 from taxi
OL,9,Fdriver licence holders.
